Besides the adaptation expenditure data, all other variables are obtained from publicly available sources. The category ‘‘Dimensions’’ lists the dimensions by which each data point can vary; these dimensions are shown in Table 1. For instance, Private Adaptation Expenditure data points are country-, sector-, hazard-, and year-specific, while Population Density only changes with country and year.
